  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textMP: {fileID: 564591367}
  lines:
  - '[Message from Boramir]'
  - This is your first element stone.your first element stone.
  - Take it ... it has the power of water element
  - Use it to kill corrupted creatures. They are everywhere.
  - With the power of this stone and some soul you will be able to do magic.
  - You need to find more element stones to beat Gorgon.
  - You have to save me.
  textspeed: 0.02
